OL,5,G1955 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FPhil takes his guests back to
OL,7,     Fbasics at the Oak Tree Lane Yurt
OL,8,     FSite in Bratton Clovelly, Devon.
OL,9,     FThey're wowed by the Mongolian
OL,10,     Fyurts, but there are some home
OL,11,     Ftruths at dinner.
OL,12,G2030 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor the last time. There are
OL,16,     Ftears, name-calling and bitter
OL,17,     Frebukes as the payments are
OL,18,     Frevealed and the winner is
OL,19,     Fannounced.
