OL,5,G2100 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThis episode focuses on mothers
OL,7,     Fand daughters, including Jackie,
OL,8,     Fwho's trying to come to terms with
OL,9,     Fher terminally ill mother
OL,10,     FJosephine's mortality.
OL,11,G2200 24 Hours in A&E
OL,12,     FStaff nurse Sophie has only been
OL,13,     Fat King's for three weeks. One of
OL,14,     Fher patients is James, a chef who
OL,15,     Faccidentally stabbed himself in
OL,16,     Fthe thigh while chopping tomatoes.
