OL,18,     FDr Mark Putland and the trauma
OL,19,     Fteam have minutes to save a truck
OL,20,     Fdriver's severed leg. Nurse
OL,21,     FChelsea Jones fears that a horse
OL,22,     Frider might be paralysed.
